    "title": "Brewers Rally Past Dodgers in NLCS",
    "text": "• The Milwaukee Brewers defeated the Los Angeles Dodgers 6-4 in Game 4 of the National League Championship Series.\n• The Brewers earned their first trip to the World Series since 1982.\n• Garrett Mitchell hit a go-ahead homer off reliever Tanner Scott in the sixth inning.\n• The Milwaukee bullpen slammed the door late to secure the win.\n• The Brewers rallied past the Dodgers to advance in the series.",
